        "en": "Client feedback regarding clinical staff is notably divided across recent appointments. Several pet parents praise the front desk receptionists and select attending veterinarians for friendly and helpful interactions. Conversely, multiple critical reviews report negative encounters with newer doctors, citing insufficient communication, lack of accountability, and feelings that clinical concerns were dismissed."
