      "text": {
        "en": "Treatment outcomes draw frequent concern from pet owners visiting this location. While a few clients report routine wellness visits and resolved minor ear issues, more reviewers express frustration when symptoms returned after prescribed antibiotic courses. Several clients felt medical diagnoses were missed or unresolved, prompting owners to seek emergency clinics or alternative veterinary hospitals."
      }
    },
