      "title": {
        "en": "Frustrations with billing and estimates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pricing transparency is a primary source of frustration in client feedback. Several pet parents report that final invoices significantly exceeded initial exam quotes, pointing to unexpected fees for diagnostics and add-on senior evaluations. Reviewers caution that tests feel aggressively recommended, making visits substantially more costly than anticipated."
      }
    }
